  "properties": {
    "display_name": "Explore different visual styles ",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Like a **Concept Artist** who designs how characters and worlds look before they're built.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/abd61f322fe0e9a2d45cd6e69f94e83a-5.2.a.png",
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Create an Image for Your Guide\r\n\r\nYou're going to use an AI image tool to create an image for the topic of your guide. In order to generate the image, provide this information to the AI:\r\n\r\n- What should the image show?\r\n\r\n- Who is the main audience for the image?\r\n\r\n**Tip**: Give the AI feedback so it can keep refining until you have something you want to use for your guide.\r\n\r\nWhen you're done,\r\n\r\n1. Save your final image to your **Backpack**.\r\n\r\n2. Complete your Field Notes for this exploration. What assumptions did the AI make? What does that tell you about how image-generation AI behaves in general?",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
